# Cloudflare Pages redirects. Static rules first. Docs:
# https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/
#
# Kiosk link: /display (e.g. /display?kiosk=1) shows the live display.
# 200 = rewrite: the address bar keeps /display?kiosk=1 and live.html is served.
/display   /live   200
/display/  /live   200
#
# Legacy share links of the form /c/<id> (app.html still understands them, but
# without this they fell through to the landing page). Send them to ?c=<id>.
/c/:id     /app?c=:id   302
